# Screens and core widgets

Reuse `lib/core/widgets/` before drawing a new box.

| Need | Widget |
|---|---|
| Primary / secondary CTA | `AppTextButton.maxPrimary` / `maxWhite` or `LoadingButton` |
| Text input | `GenericTextField` |
| Display-only field | `AppField` |
| Filter / status tag | `AppChip` |
| إيجار / شراء | `AppSegmented` |
| Product / person row | `AppListRow` |
| Price | `AppPrice` |
| Rating | `AppRating` |
| App bar | `DefaultAppBar` |
| Image | `CachedImage` (radius `AppRadius.imageAll`) |
| Bottom sheet | `AppBottomSheets.*` — radius is `AppRadius.sheet` |

## Screen skeleton

```dart
Scaffold(
  backgroundColor: context.colors.bg,
  appBar: DefaultAppBar(title: Translate.s.home),
  body: ListView(
    padding: const EdgeInsetsDirectional.symmetric(horizontal: AppSpacing.xl, vertical: AppSpacing.lg),
    children: [
      Text(Translate.s.home, style: AppTextStyle.screenTitle(color: context.colors.text)),
      Gaps.vGap13,
      AppListRow(...),
    ],
  ),
)
```

- Split UI into `Build*` widgets under `pages/<page>/widgets/`
- Copy from `Translate.s.*` / arb — no hardcoded user-facing English on new screens
- Hairline dividers: `Divider(color: context.colors.line)` or `AppListRow` (already has a bottom line)
- Do not use `ListTile` or `Card` elevation
